        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Crichton, McG\n- Works: The Lost World, We Are Marshall\n- Roles: author, screenwriter, film director, producer\n- Topics: science fiction, medical fiction, thriller, techno thriller\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Crichton was born on October 23, 1942, and he was an American best-selling author, screenwriter, film director, and producer.\n- Michael Crichton was best known for work in the science fiction, medical fiction, and thriller genres.\n- McG, born Joseph McGinty Nichol on August 9, 1968, is an American director, producer, and former record producer.\n- Michael Crichton wrote The Lost World, a techno thriller novel published by Knopf in 1995.\n- We Are Marshall is a 2006 American historical drama biopic film directed by McG.\n- Michael Crichton died on November 4, 2008.",
